sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant AM as Account Manager
    participant Cloud as Cloud activation
    Note over Dev,AM: R = /v1/orgs/{orgId}/devices
    Dev->>AM: HTTPS POST R/claim/resolve
    alt Claim authorized
        AM-->>Dev: 201 device and provision_input
        Note over Dev,AM: Claim resolution does not activate the device
        Dev->>AM: HTTPS POST R/{deviceId}/provision
        AM-->>Dev: 201 new or 200 existing operation
        AM->>Cloud: Asynchronous activation
        loop Bounded polling while pending
            Dev->>AM: HTTPS GET R/{deviceId}/provisioning
            AM-->>Dev: operation, readiness, video_metadata
        end
        alt Activation successful
            Note over Dev,Cloud: Verify mqtt AND iot_shadow before runtime use
        else Activation failed or timed out
            Note over Dev,AM: Inspect operation and readiness failure before retry
        end
    else Claim denied
        AM-->>Dev: HTTP error, no activation started
    end
